# {{name}}

Angular web app{{#if mono}} with a Fastify API and DTOs shared through Zod schemas{{/if}}.

## Getting started

Requirements: Node 24 (`.node-version`), pnpm (`corepack enable`){{#if db}}, Docker for the local database{{/if}}.

```bash
pnpm install
{{#if db}}
pnpm db:up          # local PostgreSQL
{{/if}}
pnpm dev            # {{#if mono}}web on http://localhost:4200, API on http://localhost:3000 (proxied under /api){{/if}}{{#if single}}http://localhost:4200{{/if}}
```

## Everyday commands

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `pnpm check` | The quality gate: format, lint, typecheck, unit{{#if mono}}/API{{/if}} tests, dead-code check. Run before every push. |
| `pnpm fix` | Auto-fix lint and formatting |
| `pnpm test:e2e` | Playwright end-to-end and accessibility tests |
| `pnpm build` | Production build |

{{#if db}}
Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in the secrets before `pnpm dev`.

{{/if}}
Working on this repository with an AI agent: read `CLAUDE.md`. Issues use the forms in `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE`
(bug, feature) and are written so an agent can implement them from the description alone.
